{"supplier":"hotelbeds","supplierHotelId":"106287","name":"Annabella Diamond Hotel & Spa","description":"Overlooking the Mediterranean Sea, the modern, family-friendly Annabella Diamond Hotel & Spa is perfectly situated in Avsallar, a popular tourist destination on the Turkish Riviera. Avsallar's center is within walking distance, while the city of Alanya, with its shopping, entertainment, and historical sites such as the Castle and Red Tower, is 26 km away. Antalya International Airport is 98 km from the hotel. The hotel offers elegant rooms, some with splendid sea views. A private sandy beach with complimentary sun loungers and parasols awaits, along with a pool featuring three water slides, a children's pool, and a mini club. Guests can enjoy a well-equipped fitness center and a spa with a Turkish bath and sauna. An excellent choice for couples and families seeking a delightful beach holiday. The Annabella Diamond's main building is located directly on the beach. The Annabella Park building is across the road, approximately 350 meters from the beach and main building, accessible via an underground passage. Importantly, both buildings have their own reception and restaurant. Guests staying at Annabella Park can use all facilities in the main building, such as the snack and lobby bars, except for the main restaurant. . The hotel is provide the All Ultra Inclusive services (AUI)","address":"Avsallar MAHALLESİ ANNABELLA DIAMOND HOTEL, 1","city":"ALANYA / ANTALYA","countryCode":"TR","postalCode":"07410","lat":36.6323918,"lng":31.7551142,"stars":5,"chain":"ANNAB","giataCode":"4853","phone":"+902425171515","email":"info@annabellahotels.com","website":"www.annabellahotels.com","images":[{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/10/106287/106287a_hb_a_001.jpg","category":"exterior","order":0},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/10/106287/106287a_hb_a_002.jpg","category":"exterior","order":1},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/10/106287